<h1>Jahmyr Gibbs Becomes NFL's Highest-Paid RB: <em>3 Backs Reset the Market in One Week</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>💰 Breaking · Contracts</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Two days after Bijan Robinson became the NFL's highest-paid running back, Jahmyr Gibbs topped him. Add Jonathan Taylor's new deal signed the same day, and three running backs reset the position's market within 72 hours. Here's the full breakdown of what happened and why.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
